5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hello everyone! I'm a bit nervous, but let's all try our best to find the werewolf and keep our village safe!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I hope we can find them without anyone getting hurt.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Let's stay focused. We need to observe everyone's behavior and look for contradictions in their statements to identify the werewolf logically.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"My, what a serious atmosphere! Let's all be kind to one another while we search for the truth. I'm sure we can handle this together.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue. Let's try to keep things peaceful and supportive while we work through this together.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,Does anyone have any initial thoughts or a strategy they'd like to suggest for how we should handle the first few days?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'm not really sure... maybe we should just listen to each other carefully? I don't want to make a mistake and accuse someone innocent.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"If the Seer reveals themselves too early, they become an immediate target for the werewolf. It is more logical to gather information first and let the Seer work in secret for a while.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a very wise plan, Asuka. It's always better to be careful and protect those who are helping us from the shadows.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I think Asuka is right. Let's be patient and give the Seer time to gather information safely. It's better to be cautious at the start.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'll do my best to be helpful! Since we're all in agreement about being cautious, I'll just keep a close eye on everything for now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll... I'll do the same. I'll try my best to pay attention, even if I'm not very good at speaking up.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have no concrete information yet, I will simply monitor the flow of conversation. If anyone starts acting suspiciously or trying to manipulate the group, I will point it out.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,You are all so diligent. It warms my heart to see everyone taking this so seriously for the sake of our village.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I'll do my part as well. Let's just make sure we all feel comfortable sharing our thoughts as the days go by.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,I think we've set a good foundation for today! Let's all get some rest and hope for a peaceful night. Good luck to the Seer!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"Good luck... I hope the Seer finds something helpful. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Goodnight. Let us hope the morning brings us some clarity.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Sleep well, everyone. May we all wake up to a bright and hopeful morning tomorrow. Goodnight.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Goodnight, everyone. Let's all stay safe and see what tomorrow brings.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Yumi,Asuka,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Asuka""}"
