31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Good morning, everyone! I have some very important information to share... I'm the Seer, and I've discovered that Asuka is the werewolf!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"What? Asuka is... the werewolf? I can't believe it, but if Yumi is the Seer, then we have to believe her, right?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"That is a bold claim, Yumi. Coming out as the Seer on the first day is a risky move. Are you certain you aren't the werewolf trying to frame me to secure an early execution?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, this is quite a shock! Yumi, you seem so sincere, but Asuka is also very logical. It's hard to know who to trust so suddenly.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm torn. Yumi is usually so honest, but Asuka's point about the risk is valid. Does anyone else feel like something is off, or should we trust Yumi's vision?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm definitely not the werewolf! I wanted to protect the village as quickly as possible because I'm sure of what I saw. Please, believe me!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I want to believe Yumi. She seems so sure of herself, and she's always been so kind. Asuka, do you have anything to say other than questioning Yumi?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,My only defense is the logic of the game. A real Seer would likely wait to gather more data. Yumi's haste is a classic tactic used by werewolves to eliminate a non-threatening player quickly.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is a very difficult situation. Asuka, you are always so thoughtful, but Yumi's eyes are so full of conviction. I wonder if the truth is simply more urgent than we expected.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"If Yumi is telling the truth, we can end this now. But if she's lying, we're losing a valuable ally. @Daisuke, you seem to trust Yumi; do you see anything in Asuka's reaction that feels unnatural?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Daisuke"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm not lying! I just couldn't bear the thought of another person being attacked tonight when I already know who the werewolf is. Please, let's trust each other and save the village!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Midori, I don't know if it's unnatural, but Asuka is just using logic to deflect. Yumi is being honest about her feelings, and that feels more real to me than a logical argument.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Feelings are not evidence, Daisuke. Emotional appeals are the easiest way to manipulate a group. If you choose to ignore logic in favor of intuition, you are playing a dangerous game with our lives.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, let's not be too harsh. Asuka, your logic is helpful, but sometimes the heart sees things that a list of rules cannot. Yumi's passion is very moving.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm starting to lean toward Yumi. Asuka, your insistence on logic is your usual style, but it also feels like a shield to avoid answering the accusation directly. If Yumi is the Seer, we must act now.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you, Midori! Please, everyone, let's vote for Asuka. I know it's scary, but I'm certain she's the werewolf. Let's protect our village together!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I'll vote for Asuka. I'm still a bit scared, but I trust Yumi's sincerity more than Asuka's arguments right now. Let's hope we're doing the right thing.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"If you choose to execute me based on a teenage girl's intuition over logical reasoning, you are making a grave mistake. I am human, and you are simply falling for a deception.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I feel very sad that it has come to this, but Yumi's heart seems so pure. I will trust her and vote for Asuka, hoping for the peace of our village.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I've listened to everyone, and I believe Yumi is telling the truth. Asuka, your logic is sound, but it doesn't outweigh the Seer's revelation. I will also vote for Asuka.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
